\section{Software Environment}
\label{app:software}

All experiments were conducted with Python~3.10, PyTorch~2.1, and CUDA~12.8 on a single NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 GPU (96\,GB). Inference used vLLM~0.9.2 \cite{gao2024lmeval} with HuggingFace Transformers~4.40. Variance component estimation used StatsModels~0.14 and SciPy~1.12. A full list of pinned dependencies is available in the released code repository.

